OL,3,GNEWSAReform accuses union of
OL,4,A'inflammatory' protest email
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK has criticised a trade union
OL,7,Ffor "wild and unproven accusations"
OL,8,Fabout protests after small boat
OL,9,Fmigrants were landed in Portsmouth.
OL,11,FDemonstrators blocked roads in an
OL,12,Fattempt to stop coaches carrying the
OL,13,F120 migrants from leaving Portsmouth on
OL,14,FSunday night, following a separate
OL,15,Fprotest at the Port of Dover the day
OL,16,Fbefore.
OL,18,FReform city councillor George Madgwick
OL,19,Fsaid the city's Unison branch had sent
OL,20,Fan email to its members using
OL,21,F"inflammatory language which could
OL,22,Fcreate further conflict".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
